{% comment %}
  SehatUP on-site chat panel (Ananya)
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Replaces the tap-out-to-WhatsApp floating button with a real chat panel that
  answers product, price and policy questions using live Shopify prices.

  INSTALL
  1. Online Store -> Themes -> ... -> Edit code
  2. Snippets -> Add a new snippet -> name it  sehatup-webchat
  3. Paste this whole file in and Save
  4. Open Layout -> theme.liquid, and just above the closing </body> tag add:
       {% raw %}{% render 'sehatup-webchat' %}{% endraw %}
  5. Save.

  THEN TURN OFF THE OLD BUTTON
  The current floating WhatsApp icon comes from a Shopify app, not from the theme
  (there is no wa.me link anywhere in the theme files). Apps -> find the WhatsApp
  chat app -> disable its floating button, or uninstall the app. If you skip this
  you get two buttons stacked in the same corner.

  The widget itself is served from Vercel, so its behaviour, styling and the
  Ananya rules can be updated without ever touching the theme again.
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign chat_api = 'https://sehatup-webchat.vercel.app'
  assign chat_accent = '#ee204a'
-%}

<script
  src="{{ chat_api }}/widget.js"
  data-api="{{ chat_api }}"
  data-title="Ananya"
  data-subtitle="SehatUP health advisor"
  data-accent="{{ chat_accent }}"
  {%- comment -%}
    Where the bubble sits in the corner. Any CSS length. Raise data-bottom-mobile if a
    sticky add-to-cart bar on product pages covers the bubble on phones.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  data-bottom="20px"
  data-right="20px"
  data-bottom-mobile="16px"
  {%- comment -%}
    How many times the attention ring pulses, two seconds after the page settles.
    It stops after that rather than running forever. Set 0 to turn it off, or a
    higher number if the bubble is getting missed on busy pages.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  data-pulse="3"
  data-greeting="Hello! Main Ananya hu SehatUP se. Product, price ya health concern - kuch bhi puchiye."
  data-chips="Weight loss ke liye kya lu?|Periods ki problem hai|Free consultation kaise hoti hai?|Delivery kitne din me?"
  {%- comment -%}
    Upload Ananya's photo in Content -> Files, then paste its URL here. A real face
    lifts engagement noticeably over an initial in a circle. Leave empty to use the
    initial instead.
    Example: data-avatar="{{ 'ananya.jpg' | file_url }}"
  {%- endcomment -%}
  data-avatar=""
  defer></script>
